# Processor catalogue

Per-section format: **Type / Category / `alwaysDirty`**, **Inputs / Outputs**, **Params**, **Behaviour**, **State / caches**, **Notes**.

Subsystem context: `node-engine.mdc`, `animation-system.mdc`, `geometry-contour.mdc`, `text-composition.mdc`, `effects-and-shaders.mdc`, `publish-plane.mdc`.

Categories: `input`, `animTrigger`, `animMod`, `animCtrl`, `imageOp`, `contour`, `output`, `util`. Legacy `depth | ai | source | process | marigold | dnf` aliases tolerated for snapshot back-compat (no live processors use them).

