## Cross-cutting reminders

- Adding a new processor — see `node-engine.mdc → Adding a new processor`. Add a section here.
- Removing — keep a "Removed" note for one release (engine logs `Unknown processor type: <type>` and skips). Auto-migration would live in `useSceneHistory.applySnapshot`.
- Renaming a slot — touches `SLOT` enum, `SLOT_COMPAT`, every processor's `def`, every shader. Don't do casually.
